// DRIFTWING - courier of the Hundred Isles. A flying game over a voxel
// landscape, drawn by this script at 400x240: full screen (pixel size 2)
// or in a window in the middle of the 800x480 panel (pixel size 1).
//
// You fly the little red courier plane of Driftwing Post, drawn in 3D
// every picture (its propeller turning), over a world of four regions:
// the Hundred Isles (islands, snowy peaks, villages, fields), the Red
// Canyons (layered mesas, canyons, adobe villages), the Frost Peaks
// (mountains, ice, pines) and the Ember Coast (volcanoes glowing with
// lava, lagoons, palms). Each route is a course of gates in a region, to
// fly through before the time runs out (each gate gives time back), with
// letters to gather; Free Flight has no gates and no clock (T changes the
// time of day). A minimap (top right) turns with the plane; the
// altimeter (left) shows the plane over the ground under it.
//
// The landscape: a 1024x1024 heightmap and colour map (driftwing.wad,
// made by tools/terrain.py and make_wad.py), wrapping, so the world goes
// on for ever. It is drawn column by column, near to far: each step of
// distance gives a line across the map; each screen column takes its
// cell's height, projects it, and draws only what rises above what is
// nearer (the sides of cliffs darker). Banking tilts the horizon; the
// distance fades into the haze.
//
// Keys
//   left / right (Q D, A)   bank and turn
//   up / down (Z S, W)      climb, dive
//   Space (K)               boost (the gauge refills)
//   C                       the camera: chase, far, high, low
//   U / J                   tilt the camera up, down
//   T                       the time of day (Free Flight)
//   Enter                   pause; Escape leaves (asks)
//   M                       full screen or a window
//   P                       the time a picture takes

// --- generated by tools/make_wad.py: do not edit by hand ---
#define MAPN 1024
#define SEA 70
#define NROUTES 5
#define STORY_INTRO 0
#define STORY_END 502
#define KEY 0x1FF8
#define CITY_X 48
#define CITY_Y 848
#define CITY_R 78
// --- end of the generated part ---

#define SW 400
#define SH 240
#define HALFW 200
#define FOCAL 230
#define FAR 300
#define NEAR 56
#define MAXGATES 24
#define MAXLETTERS 80
#define MAXBALLOONS 12
#define MAXBIRDS 10
#define MAXP 80

#define KEY_UP 122
#define KEY_LEFT 113
#define KEY_DOWN 115
#define KEY_RIGHT 100
#define KEY_W 119
